&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking an executive Head of Global Enablement to lead, scale, and elevate our global GTM enablement strategy and delivery. Reporting to the SVP of GTM Operations, you will lead the team responsible for onboarding, continuous upskilling, and performance optimization across our global GTM organization (AE, XDR, SE,&amp;nbsp;etc)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will act as a core strategic partner to GTM executive leadership, Revenue Operations, Product Marketing, and Product Management to translate complex multi-product platform updates, regulatory changes, and competitive dynamics into high-impact, measurable enablement programs that accelerate quota attainment, shorten deal cycles, and expand our ACV bookings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
