&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntu _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Strategize on key initiatives alongside of Global Sales Strategy and Senior Sales Leadership Team Members&lt;/p&gt;
