&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;8+ years of relevant experience in a Solution Engineering role&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in a relevant field is a nice to have&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
