&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical thinking and problem-solving skills &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication and interpersonal skills, with experience interfacing with senior leadership and executives &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment and managing multiple priorities effectively &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
