&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Senior Cloud Operations Engineer to join the global Cloud Operations team. You will support production customers by monitoring and maintaining a highly distributed, scalable and resilient global cloud infrastructure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your Mission&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To work with distributed teams in order to provide support to customers through automation, deployment, incident response related tasks.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;be working with the monitoring, tuning, maintenance, and support of Linux, Azure SQL, Kubernetes, Kafka, MongoDB, cloud infrastructure/services, etc. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will define, measure, and meet key operational metrics including performance, incidents, capacity, and availability &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will run incident resolution within the environment,&amp;nbsp;facilitating&amp;nbsp;teamwork with other departments as&amp;nbsp;required &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;build out lifecycle processes to mitigate risk and ensure platforms&amp;nbsp;remain&amp;nbsp;current,&amp;nbsp;in accordance with&amp;nbsp;industry standard methodologies &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will automate the deployment of new software to cloud environment in coordination with DevOps engineers &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;You Are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Highly organized and meticulous with excellent process management skills, capable of leading multiple tasks with shifting priorities while functioning in a rapidly changing environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Experience Includes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree or&amp;nbsp;Master’s Degree&amp;nbsp;in Computer Science, Engineering or related field&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7 years of professional experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2&amp;nbsp;or more years working with the Microsoft Azure platform (preferred) or another public cloud platform &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1&amp;nbsp;or more years of experience in automation tools like Terraform, Linux scripting, Cloud Orchestration tools like Ansible or Chef, etc. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to write scripts in one major scripting language such as Bash, PowerShell &amp;amp;/or Python &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to plan,&amp;nbsp;schedule&amp;nbsp;and monitor work activities&amp;nbsp;in order to&amp;nbsp;meet time and quality targets. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Container and DevOps technologies &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
