&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to think of various Algorithms, given a problem&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid understanding of agile software development lifecycle&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
